{"id":"a1bbaa8bc1a8f86f","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-extension.md","title":"Extension","display":"df-extension — Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-extension","aliases":["93-df-extension"],"display":"df-extension — Extension","depends_on":["[[93-df-language]]","[[93-df-consequence]]","[[93-df-theory]]","[[93-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extension — Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cf7108c33537548a\" href=\"?note=cf7108c33537548a\" title=\"93-df-theory\">93-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1\">\\(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1\\)</span> are language candidates; their symbol sets and arity maps are recovered from the language triples.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_0,\\mathrm{Cn}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_0,\\mathrm{Cn}_1\\)</span> are explicitly supplied consequence operators.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}\\)</span> have their sourced meanings; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S_0,\\alpha_0,S_1,\\alpha_1\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathcal L_0=\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal L_1=\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land S_0\\subseteq S_1\n\\land\\alpha_1\\upharpoonright S_0=\\alpha_0\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S_0,\\alpha_0,S_1,\\alpha_1\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\mathcal L_0=\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal L_1=\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land S_0\\subseteq S_1\n\\land\\alpha_1\\upharpoonright S_0=\\alpha_0\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_{93}(T_0,\\mathcal L_0,\\mathrm{Cn}_0;T_1,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathrm{Cn}_1)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists S_0,\\alpha_0,S_1,\\alpha_1\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L_0=\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal L_1=\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn}_0)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn}_0)=\\mathcal P(T_{\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn}_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn}_1)=\\mathcal P(T_{\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T_0;\\mathrm{Cn}_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T_1;\\mathrm{Cn}_1)\n\\land T_0\\subseteq T_1\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_{93}(T_0,\\mathcal L_0,\\mathrm{Cn}_0;T_1,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathrm{Cn}_1)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists S_0,\\alpha_0,S_1,\\alpha_1\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L_0=\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal L_1=\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn}_0)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn}_0)=\\mathcal P(T_{\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn}_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn}_1)=\\mathcal P(T_{\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T_0;\\mathrm{Cn}_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T_1;\\mathrm{Cn}_1)\n\\land T_0\\subseteq T_1\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Language inclusion unpacks both language triples, compares symbol sets, and requires arity agreement. Theory extension additionally receives both consequence operators explicitly and checks that their domains are the corresponding generated formula universes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"a33dcee0f62c9026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"cf7108c33537548a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_0,\\mathrm{Cn}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S_0,\\alpha_0,S_1,\\alpha_1\\;\\Bigl[{}&\n\\mathcal L_0=\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal L_1=\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land S_0\\subseteq S_1\n\\land\\alpha_1\\upharpoonright S_0=\\alpha_0\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_{93}(T_0,\\mathcal L_0,\\mathrm{Cn}_0;T_1,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathrm{Cn}_1)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists S_0,\\alpha_0,S_1,\\alpha_1\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L_0=\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal L_1=\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn}_0)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn}_0)=\\mathcal P(T_{\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}))\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn}_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn}_1)=\\mathcal P(T_{\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}))\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T_0;\\mathrm{Cn}_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T_1;\\mathrm{Cn}_1)\n\\land T_0\\subseteq T_1\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2279,"backlinks":[{"id":"47e441115dc87ddf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b52d3210eeab41d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}$ is from [[93-df-extension]] and $\\mathrm{Conservative}_{93}$ is defined here."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["a33dcee0f62c9026","afd7605d365be7b6","cf7108c33537548a","ca7404158049be33"]}